MID_LGV_1LED_c11_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_B01_m01_001: My lady has been expecting you. Please, proceed.
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_B01_m01: <BLN>You must be Leda.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Buc_m01_001: I will go along with whatever milady desires.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Buc_m01_002: No matter the danger, I will continue protecting you\neven if it costs me my life.
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_Buc_m01: <BLN>No matter what.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01_001: Queen Aswan is the natural-born daughter of King\nHasdrubal, Arago's late king.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01_002: Yet I hear that true political power lies with the\nchancellor and new king, making her a puppet.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01_003: I also hear the chancellor systematically drove out all\nof her supporters.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01_004: All of which is to say that Her Majesty's place in the\nkingdom is rather delicate.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Sci_m01_005: For you to receive a sudden invitation from someone\nin her position... Well.
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_Sci_m01: <BLN>Well.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_001: Hehe. This'll be my first time at a banquet! It's like\na dream.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_002: You must be pretty great to get invited to a place\nwith kings and queens and stuff!
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_003: Maybe I should ask Olympia for some etiquette\npointers so I don't stick my foot in it.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_004: Oh, that reminds me! The other day Kalla gave me a\npoetry-writing lesson.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_005: I was so thankful. Isn't Kalla just the kindest, most\nwonderful woman you ever met?
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Moo_m01_006: And now, while I'm here, I'm gonna learn all I can\nfrom all sorts of people!
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_Moo_m01: <BLN>Gotta learn what I can!
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Oly_m01_001: I know all too well Queen Aswan's situation.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Oly_m01_002: After all, having authority does not necessarily mean\none has freedom.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Oly_m01_003: I fled from a situation similar to hers before finding\nmy place with Kalla.
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_Oly_m01: <BLN>I understand her quite well.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01_001: As long as you remain here, you will never want for\nwater to drink or bathe in.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01_002: This city has a virtually endless supply of clean water\ndelivered by aqueduct.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01_003: The channels that stretch to the faraway mountains,\nand the system distributing water through this city...
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01_004: Both were created by my brother Credna, the Spark \nof the Forge.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_Car_m01_005: Though...to cities lacking clean water, I'm sure it\nwould all seem an egregious extravagance.
MID_LGA_1LED_c11_Car_m01: <BLN>It is rather extravagant.